# Never let the local machine's data ride along into an image.
#
# data/ holds the SQLite database — real customer names, phone numbers, addresses
# and session rows — plus the development mail outbox. public/uploads and uploads
# hold real faces and booking PDFs with names and phone numbers in them. Whatever
# is on this laptop belongs on this laptop: a build context that carried any of it
# would push it to a registry where it can be pulled back out years later.
.git/
.gitignore
data/
uploads/
public/uploads/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
npm-debug.log*
*.log
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
.qoder/
